  "body": "Positioned in the sought-after suburb of Eastern Beach, this property presents an exciting opportunity for investors, developers or those looking to secure a foothold in a premium coastal location.\r\n\r\nSet on 710sqm of flat land and zoned Mixed Housing Suburban, there is plenty of scope to explore future development potential. The property currently comprises two units, each offering two bedrooms, one bathroom (unit one has an extra toilet) and a single-car garage, plus additional off-street parking. Both are currently tenanted.\r\n\r\nLifestyle is a real highlight, with Rogers Park, Bucklands Beach Tennis Club and Eastern Beach all close by. Families will appreciate the sought-after school zones for Bucklands Beach Primary, Bucklands Beach Intermediate and Macleans College, while Half Moon Bay Marina offers a range of amenities and convenient ferry connections to the CBD and Waiheke Island.\r\n\r\nWith a desirable location, existing rental income and future potential to investigate, this is an opportunity worth exploring. The vendors will also consider a long settlement, offering added flexibility for prospective buyers.\r\n\r\nCall Lawrence or Wendy to arrange a private appointment.",
